{"slug": "wording-standbeeld-van-stadhouder-willem-iii", "synopsis": "This 1921 film follows sculptor Toon Dupuis and workshop assistants as they make a bronze equestrian statue of stadtholder William III. Workers shape and refine the life-size horse and rider, coating and working their surfaces while moving between separate figures and the assembled composition. Close views emphasize the scale of the sculpture and the manual labor required to form details such as the rider\u2019s clothing, the horse\u2019s body, and its harness.\\\\n\\\\nAfter the workshop stages, crews use ladders, ropes, scaffolding, and lifting equipment to raise the completed statue outdoors. Workers guide and cover the suspended sculpture as they position it on its pedestal.", "clips": [{"id": "4dcb7bdb-80b8-5bd4-97c3-97c7bdafd1aa", "sourceSlug": "wording-standbeeld-van-stadhouder-willem-iii", "sourceTitle": "Wording standbeeld van stadhouder Willem III", "sourceYear": 1921, "position": 0, "startSeconds": 0.0, "endSeconds": 4.68, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/wording-standbeeld-van-stadhouder-willem-iii/clips/0000000000-0000004680.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/wording-standbeeld-van-stadhouder-willem-iii/thumbnails/0000000000-0000004680.jpg"}, {"id": "446808d6-0983-58f3-96ae-f045439a1994", "sourceSlug": "wording-standbeeld-van-stadhouder-willem-iii", "sourceTitle": "Wording standbeeld van stadhouder Willem III", "sourceYear": 1921, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 4.68, "endSeconds": 11.04, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/wording-standbeeld-van-stadhouder-willem-iii/clips/0000004680-0000011040.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/wording-standbeeld-van-stadhouder-willem-iii/thumbnails/0000004680-0000011040.jpg"}, {"id": "ca6bdf36-6095-5fc2-abbb-2cb1de6aece2", "sourceSlug": "wording-standbeeld-van-stadhouder-willem-i